{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceElem\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabInplaceElem</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Term/TermElabM.html#Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab\">Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elaborates `inplace_elem`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceElem","kind":"def","line":1065,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceElem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L1065-L1076"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceIndex\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabInplaceIndex</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Term/TermElabM.html#Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab\">Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elaborates `inplace_index`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceIndex","kind":"def","line":1053,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceIndex","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L1053-L1061"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceChoose\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabInplaceChoose</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Term/TermElabM.html#Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab\">Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elaborates `inplace_choose`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceChoose","kind":"def","line":1044,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.elabInplaceChoose","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L1044-L1049"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceChoose\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceChoose</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`inplace_choose a e f` is `e` if `a` is an array and `f` if it is a slice: `inplace a do …` expands\nto both programs, and elaborates the one for the type of `a`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceChoose","kind":"def","line":462,"name":"inplaceChoose","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L462-L466"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceElem\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceElem</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`inplace_elem a v` is the value `v` of a write to the array or slice `a` of an `inplace` program,\nelaborated as an element of `a`, so that a type error names `v`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceElem","kind":"def","line":456,"name":"inplaceElem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L456-L460"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceIndex\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceIndex</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`inplace_index i` is the `USize` index `i` of a read or a write of an `inplace` program, with an\nerror that says so for an index of another type, such as a `Nat`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceIndex","kind":"def","line":450,"name":"inplaceIndex","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L450-L454"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#Lean.Parser.Category.inplaceInternal\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Category</span>.<span class=\"name\">inplaceInternal</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Notation.html#Lean.Parser.Category\">Category</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The internal terms of the expansion of an `inplace` program. They aren't terms of the `term`\ncategory, so they can't be written outside of the expansion, and their names aren't keywords.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#Lean.Parser.Category.inplaceInternal","kind":"def","line":444,"name":"Lean.Parser.Category.inplaceInternal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L444-L448"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceInternal.quot\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceInternal</span>.<span class=\"name\">quot</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceInternal.quot","kind":"def","line":444,"name":"inplaceInternal.quot","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L444-L448"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceTerm\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceTerm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`inplace a do …` is the in-place program on `a` that the statements describe, run on `a`: it\nreturns the program's result and the new array, or, with `then k`, `k` on them and the new array's\nsize. See the module documentation of `ScalarArray.Notation`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceTerm","kind":"def","line":436,"name":"inplaceTerm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L436-L442"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceApp\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceApp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"An application `f x …`, such as `pure x`, isn't a statement of an `inplace` program: this reports\nit, with the statements that are, rather than a parse error.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceApp","kind":"def","line":430,"name":"inplaceApp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L430-L434"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceMulEq\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceMulEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`x *= e` isn't a statement of an `inplace` program: this reports it, with what to write.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceMulEq","kind":"def","line":428,"name":"inplaceMulEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L428-L429"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceSubEq\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceSubEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`x -= e` isn't a statement of an `inplace` program: this reports it, with what to write.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceSubEq","kind":"def","line":426,"name":"inplaceSubEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L426-L427"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceAddEq\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceAddEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`x += e` isn't a statement of an `inplace` program: this reports it, with what to write.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceAddEq","kind":"def","line":424,"name":"inplaceAddEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L424-L425"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceStmtReturn___\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceStmtReturn___</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`return e` ends the program with the result `e`, and `return` with `()`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceStmtReturn___","kind":"def","line":422,"name":"inplaceStmtReturn___","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L422-L423"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceMatch\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceMatch</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`match e with | p => … | q => …` runs the block of the first pattern that `e` matches.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceMatch","kind":"def","line":420,"name":"inplaceMatch","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L420-L421"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceMatchAlt\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceMatchAlt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"An alternative `| p => …` of a `match` statement.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceMatchAlt","kind":"def","line":418,"name":"inplaceMatchAlt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L418-L419"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceContinue\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceContinue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`continue` goes on with the next step of the innermost loop.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceContinue","kind":"def","line":416,"name":"inplaceContinue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L416-L417"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceBreak\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceBreak</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`break` leaves the innermost loop, with the current values of its variables.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceBreak","kind":"def","line":414,"name":"inplaceBreak","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L414-L415"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceWhile\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A loop that runs while `c` holds, with the variables of its `with` clause.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceWhile","kind":"def","line":411,"name":"inplaceWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L411-L413"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceFor\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceFor</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A loop over `j` in a range such as `lo...hi` or `reverse lo...hi`, by steps of `s` with `by s`, with\nthe variables of its `with` clause; `for h : j in …` names the bounds of `j`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceFor","kind":"def","line":405,"name":"inplaceFor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L405-L410"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceLoopVars\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceLoopVars</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The variables of a loop, `with (x := init) (y : t := init) …`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceLoopVars","kind":"def","line":403,"name":"inplaceLoopVars","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L403-L404"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceStmtUnless_Do_\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceStmtUnless_Do_</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`unless c do …` runs the block if `c` doesn't hold.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceStmtUnless_Do_","kind":"def","line":401,"name":"inplaceStmtUnless_Do_","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L401-L402"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtIfLet_:=_Then_Else_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtIfLet_:=_Then_Else_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`if let p := e then … else …` runs the first block if `e` matches the pattern `p`, with its\nvariables, and the second one otherwise.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtIfLet_:=_Then_Else_»","kind":"def","line":396,"name":"«inplaceStmtIfLet_:=_Then_Else_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L396-L400"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtIf_:_Then_Else_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtIf_:_Then_Else_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`if c then … else …` runs one of two blocks.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtIf_:_Then_Else_»","kind":"def","line":394,"name":"«inplaceStmtIf_:_Then_Else_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L394-L395"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmt_:=__1»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmt_:=__1»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`(x, y) := e` assigns the mutable variables of the pattern `(x, y)`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmt_:=__1»","kind":"def","line":392,"name":"«inplaceStmt_:=__1»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L392-L393"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmt_:=_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmt_:=_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`x := e` assigns the mutable variable `x`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmt_:=_»","kind":"def","line":390,"name":"«inplaceStmt_:=_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L390-L391"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtHave_:_:=_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtHave_:_:=_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`have h : t := p` adds the fact `h` to the context, for the bounds of later indices; as in terms,\n`h` defaults to `this`, and `t` to the type of `p`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtHave_:_:=_»","kind":"def","line":385,"name":"«inplaceStmtHave_:_:=_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L385-L389"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLet_:=_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtLet_:=_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`let p := e` binds the value of the pure term `e` to the pattern `p`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLet_:=_»","kind":"def","line":383,"name":"«inplaceStmtLet_:=_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L383-L384"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLet_:_:=_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtLet_:_:=_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`let x : t := e` binds the value of the pure term `e` of type `t` to `x`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLet_:_:=_»","kind":"def","line":381,"name":"«inplaceStmtLet_:_:=_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L381-L382"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLetMut_:_:=_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtLetMut_:_:=_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`let mut x := e` declares the mutable variable `x`, and `let mut x : t := e` gives its type.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLetMut_:_:=_»","kind":"def","line":379,"name":"«inplaceStmtLetMut_:_:=_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L379-L380"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLet_←_»\"><span class=\"name\">«inplaceStmtLet_←_»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`let x ← m` runs the in-place program `m` (an `XArray.InPlace n α`, for the program's size `n`)\nand binds its result to `x`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#«inplaceStmtLet_←_»","kind":"def","line":374,"name":"«inplaceStmtLet_←_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L374-L378"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_na