 class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#Lean.Parser.Category.inplaceStmt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Category</span>.<span class=\"name\">inplaceStmt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Notation.html#Lean.Parser.Category\">Category</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A statement of an `inplace` program.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#Lean.Parser.Category.inplaceStmt","kind":"def","line":366,"name":"Lean.Parser.Category.inplaceStmt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L366-L367"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.evalInplaceBound\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">evalInplaceBound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Tactic\">Lean.Elab.Tactic.Tactic</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elaborates `inplace_bound`: runs its proof search, and reports a failure with the bound.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.evalInplaceBound","kind":"def","line":344,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.evalInplaceBound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L344-L364"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceBound\"><span class=\"name\">inplaceBound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Proves the bound `i.toNat < n` of an index in an `inplace` program: for `i = off + j`, from a\nwindow hypothesis `off.toNat + len.toNat ≤ n` and the loop bound `j.toNat < len.toNat`, or else by\n`lia` from the hypotheses in context, or else by `grind`, for `USize` arithmetic that may wrap\naround. Conjunctions in context are split first.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#inplaceBound","kind":"def","line":335,"name":"inplaceBound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L335-L341"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.lt_of_succ_le\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">lt_of_succ_le</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hj</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of a loop over `lo + 1...hi`, which is `lo<...hi`, is above `lo`. For internal use by the\n`inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.lt_of_succ_le","kind":"theorem","line":295,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.lt_of_succ_le","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L295-L301"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.le_of_lt_succ\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">le_of_lt_succ</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">hi </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">_h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hj</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hi</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of a loop over `lo...hi + 1`, which is `lo...=hi`, is at most `hi`. The proof doesn't need\n`hi + 1` not to wrap around, but the loop does, so the notation passes that fact here too.\nFor internal use by the `inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.le_of_lt_succ","kind":"theorem","line":286,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.le_of_lt_succ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L286-L293"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.step_lt\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">step_lt</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">hi </span><span class=\"fn\">s </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hk</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.stepCount\">stepCount</a> <span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <span class=\"fn\">hi</span> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index `lo + s * k` of the step `k` of `lo...hi` by `s` is below `hi`. For internal use by the\n`inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.step_lt","kind":"theorem","line":278,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.step_lt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L278-L284"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.step_le\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">step_le</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">hi </span><span class=\"fn\">s </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hk</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">k</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.stepCount\">stepCount</a> <span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <span class=\"fn\">hi</span> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lo</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index `lo + s * k` of the step `k` of `lo...hi` by `s` is at least `lo`. For internal use by the\n`inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.step_le","kind":"theorem","line":270,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.step_le","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L270-L276"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.withExit\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">withExit</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Sort</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Sort</a> v}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`f k`. The notation `inplace` writes a loop that may `break` as `withExit (fun brk => loop) k`, with\nthe rest `k` of the program after the loop, which `break` calls: elaborated as the arguments of\n`withExit`, the loop comes first and fixes the type of `k`.\nFor internal use by the `inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.withExit","kind":"def","line":261,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.withExit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L261-L268"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.stepCount\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">stepCount</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lo </span><span class=\"fn\">hi </span><span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The number of steps of the range `lo...hi` by `s`, for `s > 0`: of the indices `lo + s * k` below\n`hi`.\nFor internal use by the `inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.stepCount","kind":"def","line":231,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.stepCount","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L231-L238"}},{"header":"<div class