.Notation.toNat_add_lt_of_window_of_lt","kind":"theorem","line":222,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.toNat_add_lt_of_window_of_lt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L222-L229"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.toNat_add_lt_of_window\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Notation</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_add_lt_of_window</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">off </span><span class=\"fn\">len </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hw</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">off</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hj</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">off</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index `off + j` of a window of `len` elements at `off` is in bounds, for `j < len`. For internal\nuse by the `inplace` notation.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Notation.html#ScalarArray.Notation.toNat_add_lt_of_window","kind":"theorem","line":214,"name":"ScalarArray.Notation.toNat_add_lt_of_window","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/7ffd513add11df79848981c4efa28480b0e2e483/ScalarArray/Notation.lean#L214-L220"}}],"imports":["Init","Lean.Elab.Tactic","Lean.Elab.Term","ScalarArray.Internal"],"instances":[],"name":"ScalarArray.Notation"}